TIMING AND RESOLUTION
The idle cycle is two seconds. It has 24 source samples at 12 samples/second.
The 60 fps video holds each source sample for five display frames. It does not
contain 60 independently authored poses per second and makes no game-runtime
performance claim. The native Blender timeline is 24 fps with every second
frame sampled. Key 49 closes the two-second loop.

The source crop is 466 x 1198 pixels. The included 932 x 2396 extreme-pose
images are 2x proof renders of those original pixels, not newly authored
high-resolution detail. Native PNGs are resampled from the 2x proof masters.

