HOW THE RIG WORKS
Authored source masks define nine semantic regions. A single continuous UV
surface avoids cracks along shared source boundaries. Independent weighted
controls deform the coat panels, a very small chest-cloth area, and the brass
lantern body. Shared cloth seams are pinned. The lantern has a 0.9-degree
hinge sweep while the carried bail and hand stay in place. This is a small
idle/deformation proof, not evidence of articulated locomotion or attack.

