REBUILD
Open the packed .blend in Blender 4.3.2 and scrub frames 1 through 48.
For a deterministic source reconstruction, from this directory run:
  python source/build_static_layers.py
  python source/prepare_control_fields.py
  blender -b --python source/build_continuous_rig.py
  blender -b --python source/render_idle_samples.py
  python source/finish_study.py
The Python preparation tools require Pillow, NumPy and SciPy. Rendering
requires Blender; the video uses FFmpeg. The reconstruction reads the unchanged
reference at ../reference/canonical_original_C_RUST.png. Source Python files
are art-authoring/export tools; they contain no game or engine implementation.
